1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,990
(Transcribed by TurboScribe. Go Unlimited to remove this message.) Hayden's neighbor moved out a month ago.

2
00:00:05,010 --> 00:00:06,170
Hayden was happy.

3
00:00:06,730 --> 00:00:09,810
She hated her old neighbor, who played music

4
00:00:09,810 --> 00:00:10,330
loudly.

5
00:00:11,390 --> 00:00:13,990
Because of that, Hayden could not focus on

6
00:00:13,990 --> 00:00:14,730
her homework.

7
00:00:15,530 --> 00:00:17,430
A new neighbor moved in yesterday.

8
00:00:18,270 --> 00:00:19,830
Hayden wanted to say hello.

9
00:00:20,790 --> 00:00:22,990
Hayden knocked on her neighbor's door.

10
00:00:23,710 --> 00:00:26,250
A girl of her age opened the door.

11
00:00:27,210 --> 00:00:30,130
Hi, how can I help you, she asked.

12
00:00:30,550 --> 00:00:32,370
I just wanted to say hi.

13
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:34,870
I'm your neighbor, Hayden said.

14
00:00:35,470 --> 00:00:37,150
Oh cool, I'm Betty.

15
00:00:37,690 --> 00:00:39,790
Do you go to George Kramer High School,

16
00:00:40,150 --> 00:00:40,870
Hayden asked.

17
00:00:41,370 --> 00:00:43,030
Yes, Betty said.

18
00:00:43,690 --> 00:00:44,770
Hayden was happy.

19
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:46,770
They could study together.
